  "sentences": [
   {
    "en": "I want to tell you something important about tomorrow.",
    "zh": "我想跟你說一件關於明天的重要事。"
   },
   {
    "en": "She asked me a question, but I didn't know the answer.",
    "zh": "她問我一個問題，可是我不知道答案。"
   },
   {
    "en": "Can you explain this word? I don't understand it.",
    "zh": "你可以解釋這個字嗎？我不懂它的意思。"
   },
   {
    "en": "My brother always talks too much and shouts at me.",
    "zh": "我哥哥總是話太多，還會對我大吼。"
   },
   {
    "en": "I think you are right, but I don't really agree.",
    "zh": "我認為你說得對，但我真的不認同。"
   },
   {
    "en": "We discussed the plan and decided to start on Monday.",
    "zh": "我們討論了計畫，決定禮拜一開始。"
   },
   {
    "en": "Could you describe the street where you live? I can't remember it.",
    "zh": "你可以描述一下你住的那條街嗎？我記不得了。"
   },
   {
    "en": "He forgot to reply to my email yesterday evening.",
    "zh": "他昨天晚上忘記回覆我的電子郵件。"
   },
   {
    "en": "Don't shout! I can't hear what you are saying.",
    "zh": "別大聲！我聽不清你在說什麼。"
   },
   {
    "en": "I hope you will remember my party tomorrow.",
    "zh": "我希望明天你還記得我的派對。"
   },
   {
    "en": "She wrote her name at the top of the page.",
    "zh": "她把名字寫在那一頁的最上面。"
   },
   {
    "en": "We talked about the film and told funny stories.",
    "zh": "我們聊了那部電影，還講了有趣的故事。"
   },
   {
    "en": "I suppose you are right, but I want to know more.",
    "zh": "我想你是對的，不過我想知道更多。"
   },
   {
    "en": "Please spell your surname; I didn't hear it clearly.",
    "zh": "請拼出你的姓氏，我剛才沒聽清楚。"
   }
  ],
  "tips": [
   "say 後面直接接說的內容，tell 一定要先接人：說 something 是 say，告訴某人某件事是 tell somebody something，這兩組千萬不要互換。",
   "hear 是「聽見」，listen 是「聽」這個動作；聽廣播用 listen，看見東西才用 see。",
   "練習時把 want、hope、think、decide 後面接 to 加動詞原形，寫完立刻檢查自己是不是多加或多寫了形式。"
  ]
